IDs from GuidAttribute custom-attribute blobs, interface method order (vtable slot = index + 3 for IUnknown, +7 for IDispatch), CoCreateInstance CLSID constants, .tlb header parse (MSFT magic, typeinfo count, names). Fixtures: C# console with a [ComImport] interface and Guid attributes (builds on Linux; runtime not needed).\"},\n {\"id\":\"member-basename-vocabulary\",\"concept\":\"Member basenames re-labelled between days (D22: `dNN--variant-000.*` -> `dNN--sample.*`, `sample-stripped`, `sample-plugin`) and questions reworded to match\",\"priority\":1,\"action\":\"note\",\"detail\":\"Group members by the `dNN--` prefix only; derive role/tag from the token after the stem (stripped/symbolized, compact/direct, loader/plugin) or from the extension; never require `variant-` or `sample`. A regression case with renamed members (sed the names in a copy of the zip listing) keeps the router honest.\"},\n]\nfor g in new: assert g['id'] not in existing, g['id']\norder_front=['dotnet-pinvoke-bridge-facts','dotnet-il-callsite-facts','jni-java-native-bridge-pair','member-basename-vocabulary']\ngaps=[g for g in gaps]+new\ngaps.sort(key=lambda g:(g['priority'], 0 if g['id'] in order_front else 1))\nout='[\\n'+',\\n'.join('  '+json.dumps(g,ensure_ascii=False) for g in gaps)+'\\n]'\ns=s[:i]+s[i:i+m.start(1)]+out+s[i+m.end(1):]\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\n# validate\ns2=open(p).read(); i=s2.index('## Readiness gaps')\ng2=json.loads(re.search(r'```json\\n(.*?)\\n```',s2[i:],re.S).group(1))\nst=json.load(open('.run/prebuild-state.json'))\nopenpb=[g['id'] for g in g2 if g['action']=='prebuild' and not (st.get('binary-reverse-engineering:'+g['id'],{}).get('ok') or st.get('binary-reverse-engineering:'+g['id'],{}).get('attempts',0)>=2)]\nprint(len(g2), 'open prebuild:', openpb)\nprint(all(set(g)=={'id','concept','priority','action','detail'} for g in g2), len({g['id'] for g in g2})==len(g2))\nEOF","description":"Add new readiness gaps and re-rank"}}}
